classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ class design. Keep this file updated so it matches your final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +list~str~ preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_owner_info() str
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +int age
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +get_pet_info() str
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str category
        +bool completed
        +edit(title, duration_minutes, priority) None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +Pet pet
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +enter_task(task: Task) None
        +edit_task(task_index: int, title, duration_minutes, priority) None
        +generate_plan() list~Task~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "1..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : needs
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses constraints from
    Scheduler --> Pet : plans for
    Scheduler "1" --> "0..*" Task : manages
